{
  "key": "settlement_times",
  "title": "Settlement, Delivery & Time Rules",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Regular-Way Settlement (Effective 5/28/2024)",
      "type": "table",
      "items": [
        {
          "Product": "Corporate stocks/bonds, ETFs, Muni bonds",
          "Settlement": "T+1",
          "Source": "17 CFR 240.15c6-1 (as amended)"
        },
        {
          "Product": "U.S. Treasuries, options (premium)",
          "Settlement": "T+1 (next business day)",
          "Source": "17 CFR 240.15c6-1"
        },
        {
          "Product": "Equity option EXERCISE \u2192 stock delivery",
          "Settlement": "T+1 (NOT T+2)",
          "Source": "OCC / 17 CFR 240.15c6-1"
        },
        {
          "Product": "Index option exercise (cash)",
          "Settlement": "Next business day, cash (intrinsic value)",
          "Source": "OCC"
        },
        {
          "Product": "Cash settlement (same-day)",
          "Settlement": "Trade date",
          "Source": "17 CFR 240.15c6-1"
        },
        {
          "Product": "When-issued / when-distributed",
          "Settlement": "Date set by NSCC/issuer (on issuance)",
          "Source": "FINRA Uniform Practice Code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Dividend Dates Under T+1",
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "Ex-Dividend Date = SAME business day as Record Date (regular-way trades, T+1).",
        "Sequence: Declaration \u2192 Ex/Record (same day) \u2192 Payable.",
        "Buy ON or AFTER ex-date = NOT entitled to dividend."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reg T \u2014 Payment & Margin (Federal Reserve)",
      "type": "table",
      "items": [
        {
          "Item": "Reg T initial margin",
          "Value": "50% of purchase price"
        },
        {
          "Item": "Reg T payment deadline (customer)",
          "Value": "S+1 (2 business days after settlement = T+2 under T+1)"
        },
        {
          "Item": "Extension request",
          "Value": "To FINRA/DEA if customer cannot pay"
        },
        {
          "Item": "Failure to pay \u2192 freeze account",
          "Value": "90 calendar days (cash up-front for buys)"
        },
        {
          "Item": "FINRA min equity (long margin)",
          "Value": "$2,000"
        },
        {
          "Item": "FINRA maintenance \u2014 long / short",
          "Value": "25% / 30%"
        },
        {
          "Item": "Pattern Day Trader min equity",
          "Value": "$25,000 (FINRA Rule 4210)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prospectus Delivery \u2014 Aftermarket Windows (Securities Act \u00a710)",
      "type": "table",
      "items": [
        {
          "Offering Type": "IPO \u2014 listed (NYSE/Nasdaq)",
          "Delivery Period": "25 days after effective date"
        },
        {
          "Offering Type": "IPO \u2014 non-listed / OTC",
          "Delivery Period": "90 days after effective date"
        },
        {
          "Offering Type": "Add-on / follow-on (already public)",
          "Delivery Period": "40 days"
        },
        {
          "Offering Type": "Add-on, non-reporting issuer",
          "Delivery Period": "90 days"
        },
        {
          "Offering Type": "Mutual fund / continuous offering",
          "Delivery Period": "Ongoing \u2014 at or before confirmation"
        },
        {
          "Offering Type": "Prospectus staleness limit",
          "Delivery Period": "Info \u226416 months old if used >9 months after effective (\u00a710(a)(3))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Registration / Cooling-Off Period (Securities Act \u00a78)",
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "Cooling-off = 20 calendar days minimum between filing of registration statement and effective date (\u00a78(a)).",
        "Amendment filed before effective date restarts the 20-day clock unless SEC consents.",
        "SEC stop order: 15-day notice to issue suspending effectiveness (\u00a78(d)).",
        "During cooling-off: red-herring preliminary prospectus OK; NO sales, NO advertising, NO confirmations. Indications of interest only (non-binding).",
        "Tombstone ads permitted (\u00a72(a)(10)).",
        "\u00a723: SEC does not approve/disapprove \u2014 cannot represent otherwise."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Order Duration / GTC",
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "DAY order: expires at market close same day if not executed.",
        "GTC (Good-Til-Canceled): remains open until executed or canceled by customer.",
        "Most firms/exchanges purge GTC orders periodically (firm-specific); SIE: GTC stays until executed or canceled.",
        "GTC adjusted on ex-date for cash dividends (buy limits, sell stops reduced) unless marked DNR (Do Not Reduce)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "FINRA Filing / Registration Deadlines",
      "type": "table",
      "items": [
        {
          "Form/Event": "Form U4 \u2014 amendments (most events)",
          "Deadline": "30 days"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Form U4 \u2014 statutory disqualification events",
          "Deadline": "10 business days"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Form U5 \u2014 termination filing to CRD",
          "Deadline": "30 days; copy to RR same window"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Form U5 amendment after filing",
          "Deadline": "30 days of learning new facts"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Qualification exam after U4",
          "Deadline": "Within 120 days of filing"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Regulatory Element CE",
          "Deadline": "Annually (Rule 1240, amended 3/15/2022)"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "MQP requalification window",
          "Deadline": "Up to 5 years w/ annual CE"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "2-year tail jurisdiction for FINRA after U5",
          "Deadline": "24 months post-termination"
        },
        {
          "Form/Event": "Form 144 (affiliate resales)",
          "Deadline": "Electronically via EDGAR (since 4/13/2023)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Other Time Rules Worth Memorizing",
      "type": "table",
      "items": [
        {
          "Rule": "Confirmation delivery (Rule 10b-10)",
          "Time": "At or before completion of transaction (settlement)"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Customer account statements",
          "Time": "Quarterly minimum; monthly if activity"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Books & records (17a-4)",
          "Time": "3 yrs / 6 yrs / lifetime depending on record"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Reg D Form D filing",
          "Time": "Within 15 days of first sale"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Mutual fund forward pricing",
          "Time": "Next computed NAV after order receipt"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Mutual fund payment of redemption",
          "Time": "Within 7 calendar days (ICA \u00a722(e))"
        },
        {
          "Rule": "Broker-dealer registration (SEC)",
          "Time": "45 days to grant or institute proceedings (\u00a715(b)(1))"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "common_traps": [
    "Saying equity option EXERCISE settles T+2 \u2014 it is T+1 since 5/28/2024 (aligned with stock).",
    "Confusing ex-date with record date \u2014 under T+1 they are the SAME business day for regular-way trades.",
    "Mixing up prospectus aftermarket windows: 25 days (listed IPO), 40 days (follow-on reporting), 90 days (non-listed IPO or non-reporting add-on).",
    "Thinking the 20-day cooling-off is business days \u2014 it is 20 CALENDAR days (\u00a78(a)).",
    "Confusing U4 amendment deadlines: 30 days standard, but 10 BUSINESS days for statutory disqualification events.",
    "Reg T payment is S+2 (two business days after settlement) \u2014 under T+1 that is 3 business days after trade, not 4."
  ],
